{"content":[{"c":["LEHI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Place in Judah where the Philistines assembled to capture Samson (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.15.9","r":"Judg.15.9","rawR":"Judg.15.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.15.9","value":"Judg.15.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 15:9"},"). The place was evidently in the hills, and after Samson’s victory (using a jawbone of an ass for a weapon), it was called “the height of the jawbone” (“Jawbone Hill,” ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"), that is, Ramath-lehi (v ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.15.17","r":"Judg.15.17","rawR":"Judg.15.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.15.17","value":"Judg.15.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"17"},"). It was apparently near a spring in a crater or depression (v ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.15.19","r":"Judg.15.19","rawR":"Judg.15.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.15.19","value":"Judg.15.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"19"},"). An adjacent cliff was called Etam (v ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.15.11","r":"Judg.15.11","rawR":"Judg.15.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.15.11","value":"Judg.15.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"11"},"). Other than somewhere in the hills behind Beth-shemesh, there is no hint of where to locate (Ramath-) Lehi."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Lehi","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jgs 15:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.15.9","rawQueryValue":"Judg.15.9","sourceRefExact":"Judg.15.9"},{"anchorText":"17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.15.17","rawQueryValue":"Judg.15.17","sourceRefExact":"Judg.15.17"},{"anchorText":"19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.15.19","rawQueryValue":"Judg.15.19","sourceRefExact":"Judg.15.19"},{"anchorText":"11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.15.11","rawQueryValue":"Judg.15.11","sourceRefExact":"Judg.15.11"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"efa4a3407cf5fa62a5cc2570109c2ae8d400d8ce7ca9229b3e3e903cceae271e","sourceItemName":"Lehi","sourceItemOrder":65,"sourceMember":"Articles/L.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Lehi","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Lehi","title":"Lehi","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}